<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>初音未来 on MEROCO</title><link>https://mint.moe/tags/%E5%88%9D%E9%9F%B3%E6%9C%AA%E6%9D%A5/</link><description>Recent content in 初音未来 on MEROCO</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://mint.moe/tags/%E5%88%9D%E9%9F%B3%E6%9C%AA%E6%9D%A5/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>大理之旅</title><link>https://mint.moe/p/%E5%A4%A7%E7%90%86%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%85/</link><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://mint.moe/p/%E5%A4%A7%E7%90%86%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%85/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/d4cfb1e309ead5d320eab808690667d7.jpg" alt="Featured image of post 大理之旅" /&gt;&lt;p&gt;10月23日至27日去大理玩了五天，除去头尾交通日，实际三天。这是我第一次来大理，特意挑国庆后的淡季，游客应该少一些，第一天傍晚安置好行理后就来大理古城逛逛，结果还是被人流吓到了。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Day1_daligucheng" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="160px" data-flex-grow="66" height="1800" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/c1b347d14cc90479e0ec65a6d322108c.jpg" srcset="https://mint.moe/c1b347d14cc90479e0ec65a6d322108c_16988042439526727006_hu_c20f21b3b966bcc5.jpg 800w, https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/c1b347d14cc90479e0ec65a6d322108c.jpg 1200w" width="1200"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;古城的商铺同质化严重，漫无目的逛了几个小时，找到了一家满目蓝色的邮政纪念品店，于是带阿喵进去拍了几张照。逛累后尝试了云南本地奶茶品牌“上山喝茶”的酸角大王，酸甜口的，非常有辨识度，我给到夯中夯！烤乳扇香甜软糯，也是一绝，请务必尝试。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Day1_amm" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="360px" data-flex-grow="150" height="800" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/12cb961fb297f2f965352ad0803f0df2.jpg" srcset="https://mint.moe/12cb961fb297f2f965352ad0803f0df2_10249289163222436043_hu_bd5af723f3160079.jpg 800w, https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/12cb961fb297f2f965352ad0803f0df2.jpg 1200w" width="1200"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
